WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.040 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
We have expanded the FireSat tutorial
by repeating the same branch-building

2
00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:08.900 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
steps across firmware, sensor
input, classification, and downlink.

3
00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:12.780 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
The result follows the complete
twenty-five-node prototype overview.

4
00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:18.620 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Before saving, review the asset,
Assurance, environment, metric assumptions,

5
00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.180 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and residual-vulnerability decisions.

6
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.240 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Canvas changes remain staged until Commit.

7
00:00:24.635 --> 00:00:28.500 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Revert restores the committed
graph, presentation, rules,

8
00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:32.940 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and profile together, so use it only
when you intend to discard the draft.

9
00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:35.880 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Auto-build and Rebuild
are different operations:

10
00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:38.060 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
they build and save immediately.

11
00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.940 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Choose Commit and wait for the
Core database success message.

12
00:00:42.280 --> 00:00:45.540 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
The application checks the loaded
version, saves the proposal,

13
00:00:45.720 --> 00:00:47.880 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and reloads authoritative results.

14
00:00:48.180 --> 00:00:52.160 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Newly created nodes receive their Core
identifiers while their local tree

15
00:00:52.160 --> 00:00:53.800 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
identities remain stable.

16
00:00:54.028 --> 00:00:56.660 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
If the commit succeeded but refresh failed,

17
00:00:56.860 --> 00:01:00.560 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
follow the recovery instructions instead
of submitting the creation again.

18
00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:04.460 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
The semantic nodes and
relationships are stored in Neo4j.

19
00:01:04.760 --> 00:01:07.560 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Loss-scoped attack-tree edges
preserve their operators

20
00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:09.120 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and documented decisions.

21
00:01:09.520 --> 00:01:13.540 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
The Loss root also retains its view
configuration: card coordinates,

22
00:01:13.820 --> 00:01:18.680 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
viewport, direction, folded branches,
selected properties, and colors.

23
00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:23.220 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Reopening the saved tree restores
that presentation without changing the

24
00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.500 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
model’s analytical meaning.

25
00:01:24.840 --> 00:01:28.300 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
MetricDefinitionsJSON stores
the root’s metric definitions

26
00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.100 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and aggregation rules.

27
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.960 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
AnalysisProfileJSON stores
scenario mode, utilities,

28
00:01:34.140 --> 00:01:38.400 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and other analysis assumptions;
leaf inputs remain with their nodes.

29
00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:42.000 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Export can produce a portable
copy or review evidence,

30
00:01:42.060 --> 00:01:44.260 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
but it may include staged changes.

31
00:01:44.680 --> 00:01:46.880 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
Retain the revision, display scope,

32
00:01:46.880 --> 00:01:49.960 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
and unresolved findings
with every exported result.

33
00:01:50.260 --> 00:01:53.620 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
At the upper right of the canvas,
select Nocturne for dark mode,

34
00:01:53.620 --> 00:01:55.640 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
then Parchment to return.

35
00:01:55.940 --> 00:01:57.760 line:92% position:50% size:94% align:center
This changes presentation only.
